Bruce Senn
Steve Vandevender
Michael James Bradford
Ann Majeske

The simple thing to do was changing a line from "yes" to "no" in =
/usr/local/etc/sshd_config:
UsePrivilegeSeparation no

Ann Majeske, HP, pointed out the Tru64 Unix-version of ssh, based on the =
commercial ssh:
http://tru64unix.compaq.com/unix/ssh/

Again, thanx alot to the above people.

Greetings
Danny Petterson


